OL,3,GNEWSAMum wants son with childhood
OL,4,Adementia to 'experience life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum has said she wants her
OL,7,Ffive-year-old son to "experience life
OL,8,Fas much as he can" after he was
OL,9,Fdiagnosed with a rare neurodegenerative
OL,10,Fcondition that has no cure.
OL,12,FSophie, from Blackpool, said Bobby has
OL,13,FMPS Sanfilippo Syndrome, often called
OL,14,F"childhood Alzheimer's" or "childhood
OL,15,Fdementia."
OL,17,FThe 35-year-old said Bobby was
OL,18,Fdiagnosed after a visit to the speech
OL,19,Fand language therapy team because of a
OL,20,Fdelay in his speech development, which
OL,21,Fled to a further referral for hearing
OL,22,Fexaminations.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
