OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMum wants son with childhood
OL,4,Adementia to 'experience life'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"To us he was our baby, you don't
OL,7,Fnotice things that others might call
OL,8,F'abnormalities' you just brush them off
OL,9,Fbecause you love your child and you
OL,10,Flove them however they develop," she
OL,11,Fsaid.
